---
import ServicePage from "../../layouts/ServicePage.astro";
import { business } from "../../data/business.js";
---
<ServicePage
  slug="boiler-repair-servicing"
  photoCategory="Boilers"
  title="Boiler Repair & Servicing"
  description={`Annual boiler servicing and boiler repairs across ${business.region} by a Gas Safe registered engineer. Free quotes.`}
  intro="A yearly service keeps your boiler safe, efficient and within its warranty. If it's already playing up, I'll find the fault and fix it properly."
>
  <h2>What's included in a boiler service</h2>
  <ul class="tick-list">
    <li>Visual check of the boiler, controls and pipework for leaks, damage or corrosion</li>
    <li>Inside of the boiler opened up, inspected and cleaned where needed</li>
    <li>Flue checked and combustion tested with a flue gas analyser</li>
    <li>Gas pressure and safety devices tested</li>
    <li>System pressure checked and topped up if needed</li>
    <li>A record of the service for your warranty and your own files</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Boiler repairs</h2>
  <p>Common problems I fix include:</p>
  <ul class="tick-list">
    <li>No heating or no hot water</li>
    <li>Boiler losing pressure or showing an error code</li>
    <li>Leaks, drips and noisy boilers</li>
    <li>Radiators not heating up properly</li>
  </ul>
  <p>I'll explain what's wrong in plain English, tell you the cost before going ahead, and let you know honestly if a repair isn't worth it.</p>

</ServicePage>
